1. A Vendor cannot sell without approval.

2. A Vendor_Product must belong to one Product.

3. Inventory cannot go below zero.

4. Orders are immutable after payment.

5. Order items must store price snapshot.

6. One Order may generate multiple Shipments.

7. A user cannot review a product they didn’t purchase.



vendor.status
1. PENDING → applied but not reviewed
2. APPROVED → allowed to list products
3. SUSPENDED → temporarily blocked
4. REJECTED → permanently denied
Only vendors with APPROVED status can create Vendor_Product listings.


